      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors present a case of Kawasaki disease with arrhythmia, aneurysms in the coronary vessels and disease recurrence in week 4. Despite late diagnosis, effective treatment with high doses of immunoglobulin and aspirin was introduced in the second week of the disease as well as during its relapse."},
